# Terraform
**/.terraform/*
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
crash.log
crash.*.log
# Saved plan files: binary, environment-specific, and they can embed variable
# values. Always regenerate with `terraform plan -out=tfplan`.
tfplan
*.tfplan
*.tfvars
*.tfvars.json
# ...but DO track the non-secret per-region value files. These hold only a region
# name, a key-pair name, and a worker count - no credentials.
!infra/tf/tfvars/*.tfvars
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json
.terraformrc
terraform.rc
